# F6 test: the stock tool change E reset is the default.
#
# With [printer] tool_change_e_reset left at its default of True,
# ACTIVATE_EXTRUDER re-bases the extruder coordinate on the newly selected
# extruder (a hidden G92 E0), so an absolute E move after the tool change is
# offset by the previous base position and runs past position_max.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG homeable_extruder.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
ACTIVATE_EXTRUDER EXTRUDER=extruder1
G28
ACTIVATE_EXTRUDER EXTRUDER=extruder
G1 E20 F600
G92 E30
ACTIVATE_EXTRUDER EXTRUDER=extruder1
G1 E60 F600
